<title>USA: Smith Corona files Chapter 11 for units.</title>
<headline>Smith Corona files Chapter 11 for units.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Corona Corp said Thursday it has filed voluntary Chapter 11 petitions for three subsidiaries -- Smith Corona Overseas Holdings Inc, SCM Inter-American Corp and SCM Ltd.</p>
<p>Smith Corona filed for Chapter 11 in July 1995.</p>
<p>The company said the filings will have no effect on operations, but is intended to protect corporate assets during its reorganization.</p>
